              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 27:1–2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mfalume Selemani achidzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka pha shaba, urewe mita tisiya, upanawe mita tisiya na chimoche mita ne na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona achitengeza birika ra mviringo ra shaba iriyoyayushwa, kula mkungo hadi mkungo mita ne nukuta ne, kula photsi kuphiya dzulu mita mbiri nukuta mbiri na mviringowe ni mita kumi na tahu nukuta mbiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tsini ya mkungo wa hiro birika kala phana mifano ya ngʼombe zotengezwa phamwenga na ro birika ririphoyayushwa zichiikpwa kurizunguluka chila uphande. Hizo ngʼombe kala zapangbwa misitari miiri kurirembesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiro birika raimiswa dzulu ya miongo ya ngʼombe kumi na mbiri za shaba. Tahu zalola vurini, tahu zalola mwakani, tahu zalola mlairo wa dzuwa na tahu zalola mtswerero wa dzuwa. Vyo vyunu vya zo ngʼombe vyakala vinalola pho kahi-kahi ya ro birika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziho wa mkpwungowe kala ni nchi ne. Nao kala unaigana na mkpwungo wa chikombe na dza ruwa ra toro. Birika kala rinaweza kumenya madzi chiasi cha lita elufu mirongo mitsano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.17+EXO.30.18+EXO.30.19+EXO.30.20+EXO.30.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 30:17–21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona piya atengeza mabeseni kumi, matsano gaikpwa uphande wa vurini na matsano gachiikpwa uphande wa mwakani wa yo nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu. Higo mabeseni gahumika kusuzira nyama ariolaviwa sadaka za kuochwa na hiro birika rahumika kuikira madzi ga alavyadzi-sadaka ga kusingira mikono na magulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
